1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:10,883
Research runs step by step, and each step reports as it finishes: read the website, build the business profile, find competitors and market data within a fixed budget of web searches, and score.

2
00:00:10,883 --> 00:00:13,216
The research tools hold no keys.

3
00:00:13,216 --> 00:00:15,680
They draft; a person decides.

